Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:0:00:25.78,WhisprsWatermark,,0,0,0,,@Whisprs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.10,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not every season is\Nmeant for blooming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.61,0:00:06.44,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Some seasons are just\Nfor resting, for staying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:07.98,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}rooted through the coldest nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:10.92,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You don't have to\Nhave it all figured
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.52,0:00:11.68,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:15.38,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're still growing even\Nin the quiet dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:18.19,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Be proud of how\Nfar you've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.89,0:00:21.47,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Soften your shoulders,\Nclose your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:24.35,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything can wait until tomorrow.
